---

This project's skill-based application workflow (job-fit evaluation, CV
tailoring, cover letter writing, interview prep, structured as a Claude Code
skill) was adapted from the pattern established by Mads Lorentzen's
"ai-job-search" (https://github.com/MadsLorentzen/ai-job-search), also
MIT-licensed:

Copyright (c) 2026 Mads Lorentzen

See the Acknowledgements section of README.md for details on what was adapted
versus written independently for this lighter-weight, browser-automation-based
sibling project.
